{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52284","headline":"诗（幷序） 四十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 四十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奉使亲监铸，改故造新光。\n开通万里达，元宝出青黄。\n本姓使流传，涓涓亿兆阳（张改作「扬」）。\n无心念贫事，□□□□□。\n有时见即喜，贵重剧耶娘。\n唯须家中足，时时对孟常（张改「尝」，项校「光」）。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}